// New math commands: integrals, cases, vectors, binomials, trig
*doc_title(New Math Commands)

# Integrals

Indefinite: *int(x^2)

With differential: *int(x^2 ; x)

Definite: *int(0 ; 1 ; x^2)

Definite with differential: *int(0 ; 1 ; x^2 ; x)

Contour: *oint(C ; F ; l)

# Piecewise and systems

*cases(x + y = 3 | x - y = 1)

*cases(
    x + y = 3
    x - y = 1
)

# Vectors and binomials

Vector AB: *vec(AB)

Binomial: *binom(n ; k)

# Trigonometry and hyperbolics

*cot(x)
*sec(x)
*csc(x)
*arcsin(x)
*arccos(x)
*arctan(x)
*sinh(x)
*cosh(x)
*tanh(x)
*coth(x)

# Nesting, variables and calc

<a> = 2
*frac(*int(0 ; 1 ; x) ; 2)
*int(0 ; <a> ; x^2)
*binom(calc(<a> + 1) ; 2)
